<title>NEW ZEALAND: Hongkong Bank cuts NZ floating, fixed rates.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank cuts NZ floating, fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Bank said on Monday it had cut its New Zealand floating mortgage rate to 10.25 percent from 10.50 percent.</p>
<p>It also cut its one-year and three-year fixed rates by a quarter of a percentage point to 9.50 and 8.95 percent, respectively.</p>
</text>
